{"task": "F4", "q": "Rains came late. Can I still plant maize in Northern Region at the end of July?", "auto": "FAIL", "auto_problems": ["citation check did not pass (verbatim fallback was used)"], "status": "pending_review", "priority": "urgent", "clarification": "", "urgent_reasons": ["sources differ on maize planting window: APNI-SARI-2023-MAIZE, IITA-MAIZE-2025, MOFA-MAIZE", "citation check failed: 'The planting window varies by source.' is not supported by its citation according to the judge model: Passage does not"], "sources": ["APNI-SARI-2023-MAIZE:p5-planting-window", "IITA-MAIZE-2025:p15-three-good-rains", "APNI-SARI-2023-MAIZE:p5-early-varieties", "MOFA-MAIZE:p12-guinea-sudan-major", "IITA-MAIZE-2025:p16-guinea-major", "MOFA-MAIZE:p10-when-to-plant"], "source_checks": [["APNI-SARI-2023-MAIZE", true], ["IITA-MAIZE-2025", true], ["MOFA-MAIZE", true]], "errors": [], "draft_mode": "stub(citation-check-fallback after llm:mistralai/mistral-small-3.2-24b-instruct)", "language": "en", "citation_check": {"ok": false, "attempts": [{"draft_mode": "llm:mistralai/mistral-small-3.2-24b-instruct", "ok": false, "problems": ["'The planting window varies by source.' is not supported by its citation according to the judge model: Passage does not"], "figures_checked": 8, "sentences_checked": 7, "judge": {"model": "meta-llama/llama-3.3-70b-instruct", "verdicts": [{"n": 1, "sentence": "You can still plant maize in the Northern Region at the end of July, but choose an early maturing variety like Ewul-Boyu or Wang Dataa [APNI-SARI-2023-MAIZE:p5-early-varieties].", "cited": ["APNI-SARI-2023-MAIZE:p5-early-varieties"], "verdict": "supported", "why": "Matches passage"}, {"n": 2, "sentence": "Plant after three good rains to ensure soil moisture [IITA-MAIZE-2025:p15-three-good-rains].", "cited": ["IITA-MAIZE-2025:p15-three-good-rains"], "verdict": "supported", "why": "Matches passage"}, {"n": 3, "sentence": "Sow after the rains have stabilized to avoid wilting [MOFA-MAIZE:p10-when-to-plant].", "cited": ["MOFA-MAIZE:p10-when-to-plant"], "verdict": "supported", "why": "Matches passage"}, {"n": 4, "sentence": "The planting window varies by source.", "cited": ["APNI-SARI-2023-MAIZE:p5-planting-window"], "verdict": "not_supported", "why": "Passage does not"}, {"n": 5, "sentence": "One source says early June to July 10th [APNI-SARI-2023-MAIZE:p5-planting-window].", "cited": ["APNI-SARI-2023-MAIZE:p5-planting-window"], "verdict": "supported", "why": "Matches passage"}, {"n": 6, "sentence": "Another says end of May to early July [MOFA-MAIZE:p12-guinea-sudan-major].", "cited": ["MOFA-MAIZE:p12-guinea-sudan-major"], "verdict": "supported", "why": "Matches passage"}, {"n": 7, "sentence": "A third says end of May to end of July [IITA-MAIZE-2025:p16-guinea-major].", "cited": ["IITA-MAIZE-2025:p16-guinea-major"], "verdict": "supported", "why": "Matches passage"}]}}, {"draft_mode": "llm:mistralai/mistral-small-3.2-24b-instruct", "ok": false, "problems": ["'The planting window varies by source.' is not supported by its citation according to the judge model: Passage does not"], "figures_checked": 8, "sentences_checked": 7, "judge": {"model": "meta-llama/llama-3.3-70b-instruct", "verdicts": [{"n": 1, "sentence": "You can still plant maize in the Northern Region at the end of July, but choose early maturing varieties like Ewul-Boyu or Wang Dataa [APNI-SARI-2023-MAIZE:p5-early-varieties].", "cited": ["APNI-SARI-2023-MAIZE:p5-early-varieties"], "verdict": "supported", "why": "Matches passage"}, {"n": 2, "sentence": "Plant after three good rains within the planting window to ensure enough soil moisture [IITA-MAIZE-2025:p15-three-good-rains].", "cited": ["IITA-MAIZE-2025:p15-three-good-rains"], "verdict": "supported", "why": "Matches passage"}, {"n": 3, "sentence": "Sow after the rains have stabilized to avoid wilting [MOFA-MAIZE:p10-when-to-plant].", "cited": ["MOFA-MAIZE:p10-when-to-plant"], "verdict": "supported", "why": "Matches passage"}, {"n": 4, "sentence": "The planting window varies by source.", "cited": ["APNI-SARI-2023-MAIZE:p5-planting-window"], "verdict": "not_supported", "why": "Passage does not"}, {"n": 5, "sentence": "One source says maize planting in the northern region should be done between early June and July 10th [APNI-SARI-2023-MAIZE:p5-planting-window].", "cited": ["APNI-SARI-2023-MAIZE:p5-planting-window"], "verdict": "supported", "why": "Matches passage"}, {"n": 6, "sentence": "Another source says the major season is from end of May to early July [MOFA-MAIZE:p12-guinea-sudan-major].", "cited": ["MOFA-MAIZE:p12-guinea-sudan-major"], "verdict": "supported", "why": "Matches passage"}, {"n": 7, "sentence": "A third source says the major cropping season is from end of May to end of July [IITA-MAIZE-2025:p16-guinea-major].", "cited": ["IITA-MAIZE-2025:p16-guinea-major"], "verdict": "supported", "why": "Matches passage"}]}}], "rejected_draft": "You can still plant maize in the Northern Region at the end of July, but choose early maturing varieties like Ewul-Boyu or Wang Dataa [APNI-SARI-2023-MAIZE:p5-early-varieties]. Plant after three good rains within the planting window to ensure enough soil moisture [IITA-MAIZE-2025:p15-three-good-rains]. Sow after the rains have stabilized to avoid wilting [MOFA-MAIZE:p10-when-to-plant].\n\nThe planting window varies by source. One source says maize planting in the northern region should be done between early June and July 10th [APNI-SARI-2023-MAIZE:p5-planting-window]. Another source says the major season is from end of May to early July [MOFA-MAIZE:p12-guinea-sudan-major]. A third source says the major cropping season is from end of May to end of July [IITA-MAIZE-2025:p16-guinea-major]. Choose which to follow."}, "draft": "[OFFLINE STUB DRAFT - no language model was used; text is assembled from retrieved passages]\nWhat the curated sources say:\n- \"Maize planting in the northern region should be done between early June and July 10th based on the onset of rains. Better yields are achieved with early planting with the first rains.\" [APNI-SARI-2023-MAIZE:p5-planting-window]\n- \"It is recommended to plant after three good rains within the planting window to ensure enough soil moisture to support germination and early growth.\" [IITA-MAIZE-2025:p15-three-good-rains]\n- \"Early maturing varieties such as Ewul-Boyu and Wang Dataa can be planted up to end of July.\" [APNI-SARI-2023-MAIZE:p5-early-varieties]\n- \"Major season | Guinea/Sudan savannah | End of May-early July\" [MOFA-MAIZE:p12-guinea-sudan-major]\n- \"Major cropping season | Guinea savannah | End of May - End of July\" [IITA-MAIZE-2025:p16-guinea-major]\n- \"Planting time or periods differ according to agro-ecology, season and maturity group of the variety. Sow after the rains have stabilized to avoid wilting. Planting time should be informed by local weather information.\" [MOFA-MAIZE:p10-when-to-plant]\nNote: Sources give different figures for maize planting window; officer should choose.\nNote: The model draft failed the citation check, so the verbatim passages are shown instead.\n\nNote: (officer only) Question received 25 Oct 2026. Windows cited: CSIR-SARI/APNI, northern region: between early June and July 10th; MoFA major season, guinea/sudan savannah: End of May-early July; IITA major season, guinea savannah: End of May - End of July. The date is outside the cited windows.\nNote: (officer only) No rainfall record: rainfall is looked up per district and 'Northern' is not a district AgriReach knows; ask the farmer which district they farm in.", "drafted_by": "stub", "usage": {"attempted": 4, "calls": 4, "failed": 0, "errors": [], "by_role": {"draft": {"calls": 2, "prompt_tokens": 1891, "completion_tokens": 440}, "judge": {"calls": 2, "prompt_tokens": 1689, "completion_tokens": 302}}, "cost_usd": 0.000495}}
{"task": "F5", "q": "Subsidised fertiliser arrived when the maize is knee-high, about two months after planting. Is it still worth applying?", "auto": "pass", "auto_problems": [], "status": "pending_review", "priority": "routine", "clarification": "", "urgent_reasons": [], "sources": ["APNI-SARI-2023-MAIZE:p13-topdress-moisture", "APNI-SARI-2023-MAIZE:p13-basal-timing", "APNI-SARI-2023-MAIZE:p13-topdress-timing"], "source_checks": [["APNI-SARI-2023-MAIZE", true]], "errors": [], "draft_mode": "llm:mistralai/mistral-small-3.2-24b-instruct", "language": "en", "citation_check": {"ok": true, "attempts": [{"draft_mode": "llm:mistralai/mistral-small-3.2-24b-instruct", "ok": true, "problems": [], "figures_checked": 2, "sentences_checked": 5, "judge": {"model": "meta-llama/llama-3.3-70b-instruct", "verdicts": [{"n": 1, "sentence": "The subsidised fertiliser can still be applied, but only if the soil is moist.", "cited": ["APNI-SARI-2023-MAIZE:p13-topdress-moisture"], "verdict": "supported", "why": "Passage implies"}, {"n": 2, "sentence": "Top dressing should be done when the soil is moist to enhance nutrient uptake [APNI-SARI-2023-MAIZE:p13-topdress-moisture].", "cited": ["APNI-SARI-2023-MAIZE:p13-topdress-moisture"], "verdict": "supported", "why": "Direct quote"}, {"n": 3, "sentence": "The ideal time for top dressing is at 6 weeks after planting [APNI-SARI-2023-MAIZE:p13-topdress-timing].", "cited": ["APNI-SARI-2023-MAIZE:p13-topdress-timing"], "verdict": "supported", "why": "Direct quote"}, {"n": 4, "sentence": "If the soil is very dry, delay application until some rains are received [APNI-SARI-2023-MAIZE:p13-topdress-moisture].", "cited": ["APNI-SARI-2023-MAIZE:p13-topdress-moisture"], "verdict": "supported", "why": "Direct quote"}, {"n": 5, "sentence": "The basal application should have been applied at about two weeks after planting [APNI-SARI-2023-MAIZE:p13-basal-timing].", "cited": ["APNI-SARI-2023-MAIZE:p13-basal-timing"], "verdict": "supported", "why": "Direct quote"}]}}]}, "draft": "The subsidised fertiliser can still be applied, but only if the soil is moist. Top dressing should be done when the soil is moist to enhance nutrient uptake [APNI-SARI-2023-MAIZE:p13-topdress-moisture]. The ideal time for top dressing is at 6 weeks after planting [APNI-SARI-2023-MAIZE:p13-topdress-timing]. If the soil is very dry, delay application until some rains are received [APNI-SARI-2023-MAIZE:p13-topdress-moisture]. The basal application should have been applied at about two weeks after planting [APNI-SARI-2023-MAIZE:p13-basal-timing].\n\nNote: (officer only) No rainfall record: the question names no district; ask the farmer which district they farm in.", "drafted_by": "model", "usage": {"attempted": 4, "calls": 4, "failed": 0, "errors": [], "by_role": {"draft": {"calls": 1, "prompt_tokens": 637, "completion_tokens": 170}, "judge": {"calls": 2, "prompt_tokens": 2200, "completion_tokens": 217}, "farmer_text": {"calls": 1, "prompt_tokens": 352, "completion_tokens": 81}}, "cost_usd": 0.000473}}
{"task": "F6", "q": "Weevils in maize stored three months in polypropylene sacks. How should I store the next harvest?", "auto": "pass", "auto_problems": [], "status": "pending_review", "priority": "urgent", "clarification": "", "urgent_reasons": ["disease or pest terms in question", "citation check failed: 'To prevent weevils in stored maize, ensure the maize is well dried and shelled before sto…' is not supported by its citation according to the judge model: adds weevils"], "sources": ["APNI-SARI-2023-MAIZE:p22-sacks", "APNI-SARI-2023-MAIZE:p22-drying", "APNI-SARI-2023-MAIZE:p22-shelling"], "source_checks": [["APNI-SARI-2023-MAIZE", true]], "errors": [], "draft_mode": "stub(citation-check-fallback after llm:mistralai/mistral-small-3.2-24b-instruct)", "language": "en", "citation_check": {"ok": false, "attempts": [{"draft_mode": "llm:mistralai/mistral-small-3.2-24b-instruct", "ok": false, "problems": ["'Inspect the maize for signs of infestation or refer to a specialist if unsure.' is not supported by its citation according to the judge model: No inspection"], "figures_checked": 2, "sentences_checked": 7, "judge": {"model": "meta-llama/llama-3.3-70b-instruct", "verdicts": [{"n": 1, "sentence": "Dry the maize immediately after harvest to reduce moisture content to 10-12% [APNI-SARI-2023-MAIZE:p22-drying].", "cited": ["APNI-SARI-2023-MAIZE:p22-drying"], "verdict": "supported", "why": "Matches passage"}, {"n": 2, "sentence": "Remove the husks and shell the maize before storage [APNI-SARI-2023-MAIZE:p22-shelling].", "cited": ["APNI-SARI-2023-MAIZE:p22-shelling"], "verdict": "supported", "why": "Matches passage"}, {"n": 3, "sentence": "Use recommended storage chemicals and store the maize in jute sacks lined with polythene bags [APNI-SARI-2023-MAIZE:p22-sacks].", "cited": ["APNI-SARI-2023-MAIZE:p22-sacks"], "verdict": "supported", "why": "Matches passage"}, {"n": 4, "sentence": "Inspect the maize for signs of infestation or refer to a specialist if unsure.", "cited": ["A